CJK font (IMPORTANT)
--------------------
`tools/gen_font.py` subsets a font **from your own machine**
(default: C:\Windows\Fonts\simhei.ttf, Microsoft copyright; the resulting
`device/main/rw1_font.c` is therefore GIT-IGNORED and must NOT be published).
Commercial/redistributable use: point FONT_IN at an open-license font you
download instead, e.g. Source Han Sans SC / Noto Sans SC (SIL OFL 1.1) or
WenQuanYi (GPL+font-exception), and re-run the script. The firmware only
requires the generated file to be present at build time.
